    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Windows 11 &amp; Windows 10</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Endless &quot;Working on it...&quot; occurs when Explorer tries to parse broken thumbnails, unreachable mapped network drives, or Quick Access shortcuts. Open <strong>Folder Options &gt; General</strong>, click <strong>Clear</strong> next to File Explorer history, disconnect offline mapped network drives, and switch folder optimization under <strong>Properties &gt; Customize</strong> from Pictures/Videos to <strong>General items</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Endless &quot;Working on it...&quot; occurs when Explorer tries to parse broken thumbnails, unreachable mapped network drives, or Quick Access shortcuts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Open <strong>Folder Options &gt; General</strong>, click <strong>Clear</strong> next to File Explorer history, disconnect offline mapped network drives, and switch folder optimization under <strong>Properties &gt; Customize</strong> from Pictures/Videos to <strong>General items</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
