    "question": "How do I fix New Outlook for Windows crashing immediately upon launch after a Windows 11 update?",
    "directAnswer": "New Outlook (olk.exe) stores local WebView2 cache that corrupts after Edge/Windows updates. Open Settings > Apps > Installed apps > Outlook (new) > Advanced options, click Repair and then Reset (re-syncs cloud mailboxes without deleting server emails), and repair Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime from Installed Apps.",
