    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Microsoft Outlook</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Toggle off <strong>New Outlook</strong> in the top-right title bar of the app. If the toggle is missing, press <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">Win + R</code>, open <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">regedit</code>, go to <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Office\\16.0\\Outlook\\Preferences</code>, set <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">UseNewOutlook</code> to <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">0</code>, and launch Classic Outlook from <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\root\\Office16\\OUTLOOK.EXE</code>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Toggle off <strong>New Outlook</strong> in the top-right title bar of the app.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>If the toggle is missing, press <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">Win + R</code>, open <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">regedit</code>, go to <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Office\\16.0\\Outlook\\Preferences</code>, set <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">UseNewOutlook</code> to <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">0</code>, and launch Classic Outlook from <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\root\\Office16\\OUTLOOK.EXE</code>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
