    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Microsoft Outlook</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Emails stall in the Outbox when attachments exceed server limits (typically 20–25 MB), Outlook is in <strong>Work Offline</strong> mode, or you opened the queued message while sending. Click <strong>Send/Receive &gt; Work Offline</strong> to verify you are online, open Outbox, move the message to <strong>Drafts</strong>, compress or link large files via OneDrive, and resend.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Emails stall in the Outbox when attachments exceed server limits (typically 20–25 MB), Outlook is in <strong>Work Offline</strong> mode, or you opened the queued message while sending.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Click <strong>Send/Receive &gt; Work Offline</strong> to verify you are online, open Outbox, move the message to <strong>Drafts</strong>, compress or link large files via OneDrive, and resend.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
