    "question": "How do I fix Outlook attachments not previewing (\"This file cannot be previewed because of an error with the previewer\")?",
    "directAnswer": "Broken attachment previews occur when the PDF/Word preview handler is disabled or Protected View conflicts with Adobe/Edge. In Outlook, go to File > Options > Trust Center > Trust Center Settings > Attachment Handling, uncheck Turn off Attachment Preview, click Attachment and Document Previewers, enable the required handlers, and repair Office if Word/Excel previewers still fail.",
