    "directAnswer": "This happens after uninstalling Chrome/Firefox without resetting the Windows default browser registry association. Open Settings > Apps > Default apps, set Microsoft Edge or Google Chrome as default for HTTP, HTTPS, and .htm/.html, and verify HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\.html default value is htmlfile or your active browser's ProgID.",
