    "title": "How do I fix Microsoft Word \"Normal.dotm\" template corruption causing weird fonts or instant crashes?",
    "question": "How do I fix Microsoft Word \"Normal.dotm\" template corruption causing weird fonts or instant crashes?",
    "directAnswer": "A corrupted global template (Normal.dotm) breaks formatting or causes startup crashes across every document. Close Word completely, navigate to %appdata%\\Microsoft\\Templates, rename Normal.dotm to Normal.dotm.old, and relaunch Word—it automatically generates a clean factory Normal.dotm.",
