    "checklist": [
      "Close Word, end any orphaned WINWORD.EXE processes in Task Manager,...",
      "Apply official diagnostic & reset steps",
      "Confirm resolution or escalate to a verified expert"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Microsoft Excel, Word &amp; PowerPoint</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Leftover hidden lock files (<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">~$DocumentName.docx</code>) or OneDrive sync lag leave documents falsely locked. Close Word, end any orphaned <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">WINWORD.EXE</code> processes in Task Manager, enable <strong>Hidden items</strong> in File Explorer to delete the <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">~$</code> owner file, or sign out and back into OneDrive if the lock is cloud-side.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Leftover hidden lock files (<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">~$DocumentName.docx</code>) or OneDrive sync lag leave documents falsely locked.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Close Word, end any orphaned <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">WINWORD.EXE</code> processes in Task Manager, enable <strong>Hidden items</strong> in File Explorer to delete the <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">~$</code> owner file, or sign out and back into OneDrive if the lock is cloud-side.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
