    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Microsoft Excel, Word &amp; PowerPoint</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">AutoSave only works for modern file formats (<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.docx</code>, <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.xlsx</code>, <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.pptx</code>) stored directly in <strong>OneDrive</strong> or <strong>SharePoint</strong>. Convert legacy <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.doc</code>/<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.xls</code> files via <strong>File &gt; Save As</strong> to <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.docx</code>/<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.xlsx</code>, save the file inside your synced OneDrive folder, and ensure <strong>Use Office applications to sync Office files that I open</strong> is enabled in OneDrive Settings.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>AutoSave only works for modern file formats (<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.docx</code>, <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.xlsx</code>, <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.pptx</code>) stored directly in <strong>OneDrive</strong> or <strong>SharePoint</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Convert legacy <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.doc</code>/<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.xls</code> files via <strong>File &gt; Save As</strong> to <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.docx</code>/<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">.xlsx</code>, save the file inside your synced OneDrive folder, and ensure <strong>Use Office applications to sync Office files that I open</strong> is enabled in OneDrive Settings.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
