    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Microsoft Excel, Word &amp; PowerPoint</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Repeated sign-in prompts are caused by conflicting work/personal Microsoft accounts in Windows Settings or corrupted WAM credentials. Open <strong>Settings &gt; Accounts &gt; Email &amp; accounts / Access work or school</strong>, remove unused/old organization accounts, clear Office entries in <strong>Windows Credential Manager</strong>, and check <strong>Allow my organization to manage my device</strong> only for active corporate accounts.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Repeated sign-in prompts are caused by conflicting work/personal Microsoft accounts in Windows Settings or corrupted WAM credentials.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Open <strong>Settings &gt; Accounts &gt; Email &amp; accounts / Access work or school</strong>, remove unused/old organization accounts, clear Office entries in <strong>Windows Credential Manager</strong>, and check <strong>Allow my organization to manage my device</strong> only for active corporate accounts.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
