    "question": "How do I fix Microsoft Office spellcheck/editor not working or switching to the wrong language?",
    "directAnswer": "Word/Outlook inherit proofing language per paragraph or from Windows keyboard layouts. Press Ctrl + A, go to Review > Language > Set Proofing Language, select your language, uncheck Do not check spelling or grammar and Detect language automatically, then click Set As Default.",
