    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Microsoft Excel, Word &amp; PowerPoint</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Word/Outlook inherit proofing language per paragraph or from Windows keyboard layouts. Press <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">Ctrl + A</code>, go to <strong>Review &gt; Language &gt; Set Proofing Language</strong>, select your language, uncheck <strong>Do not check spelling or grammar</strong> and <strong>Detect language automatically</strong>, then click <strong>Set As Default</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Word/Outlook inherit proofing language per paragraph or from Windows keyboard layouts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Press <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">Ctrl + A</code>, go to <strong>Review &gt; Language &gt; Set Proofing Language</strong>, select your language, uncheck <strong>Do not check spelling or grammar</strong> and <strong>Detect language automatically</strong>, then click <strong>Set As Default</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
