    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Microsoft OneDrive, SharePoint &amp; Teams</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Libraries with <strong>Required Checkout</strong>, Information Rights Management (IRM), or over 100,000 synced items across all libraries stall OneDrive sync. Use <strong>Add shortcut to OneDrive</strong> only for specific subfolders (not entire 100k-file sites), disable forced checkout if not required, and remove duplicate overlapping shortcuts.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Libraries with <strong>Required Checkout</strong>, Information Rights Management (IRM), or over 100,000 synced items across all libraries stall OneDrive sync.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Use <strong>Add shortcut to OneDrive</strong> only for specific subfolders (not entire 100k-file sites), disable forced checkout if not required, and remove duplicate overlapping shortcuts.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
