    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Microsoft Account, Authenticator, Microsoft Store, Surface, Edge &amp; Xbox</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Corrupted <strong>Gaming Services</strong> blocks all Game Pass installs on Windows 11. Run PowerShell as Administrator and execute <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">Get-AppxPackage <em>GamingServices</em> | Remove-AppxPackage -AllUsers</code>, delete <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\GamingServices</code> and <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">GamingServicesNet</code> in <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">regedit</code>, reboot, and reopen the Xbox App to reinstall Gaming Services cleanly.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Corrupted <strong>Gaming Services</strong> blocks all Game Pass installs on Windows 11.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Run PowerShell as Administrator and execute <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">Get-AppxPackage <em>GamingServices</em> | Remove-AppxPackage -AllUsers</code>, delete <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\GamingServices</code> and <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">GamingServicesNet</code> in <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">regedit</code>, reboot, and reopen the Xbox App to reinstall Gaming Services cleanly.</p><div class=\"kb-code-box\">Get-AppxPackage *GamingServices* | Remove-AppxPackage -AllUsers</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always back up critical files or create a System Restore point before modifying Windows Registry keys, disk partitions, or BIOS/UEFI firmware settings. Download updates and redistributables exclusively from official Microsoft portals.\n</div>"
