    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; MacBook, iMac &amp; macOS</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Corrupted Finder preference plists or broken iCloud Desktop sync freeze Finder. Press <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">Option + Command + Esc</code>, select <strong>Finder</strong>, and click <strong>Relaunch</strong>. If freezes recur, delete <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.finder.plist</code> via Terminal (<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">rm ~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.finder.plist &amp;&amp; killall Finder</code>) and check <strong>System Settings &gt; Desktop &amp; Dock &gt; Show Items &gt; On Desktop</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Corrupted Finder preference plists or broken iCloud Desktop sync freeze Finder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Press <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">Option + Command + Esc</code>, select <strong>Finder</strong>, and click <strong>Relaunch</strong>.</p><div class=\"kb-code-box\">rm ~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.finder.plist &amp;&amp; killall Finder</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 3</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Secondary Recovery &amp; Prevention</div>\n    <p>If freezes recur, delete <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.finder.plist</code> via Terminal (<code class=\"kb-inline-code\">rm ~/Library/Preferences/com.apple.finder.plist &amp;&amp; killall Finder</code>) and check <strong>System Settings &gt; Desktop &amp; Dock &gt; Show Items &gt; On Desktop</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always verify an up-to-date iCloud or local Finder/iTunes backup before choosing Restore in Recovery Mode, and never enter your Apple Account credentials on third-party unlock websites.\n</div>"
