    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; AirPods, AirTag, Apple TV &amp; HomePod</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Static or rattling in ANC/Transparency mode stems from clogged acoustic mesh vents or failed internal feedback microphones. Gently clean the black exterior microphone meshes with a soft dry brush or Blu-Tack (never liquids/sharp pins), run the <strong>Ear Tip Fit Test</strong> under <strong>Settings &gt; AirPods</strong>, update AirPods firmware while charging beside your iPhone, and check Apple's replacement eligibility if static persists in ANC mode.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Static or rattling in ANC/Transparency mode stems from clogged acoustic mesh vents or failed internal feedback microphones.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Gently clean the black exterior microphone meshes with a soft dry brush or Blu-Tack (never liquids/sharp pins), run the <strong>Ear Tip Fit Test</strong> under <strong>Settings &gt; AirPods</strong>, update AirPods firmware while charging beside your iPhone, and check Apple's replacement eligibility if static persists in ANC mode.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always verify an up-to-date iCloud or local Finder/iTunes backup before choosing Restore in Recovery Mode, and never enter your Apple Account credentials on third-party unlock websites.\n</div>"
