    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; AirPods, AirTag, Apple TV &amp; HomePod</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">HomePod fails setup when the iPhone is on a 5 GHz guest/enterprise network with AP Isolation or Keychain/HomeKit sync is off. Verify iCloud <strong>Passwords &amp; Keychain</strong> and <strong>Home</strong> are enabled on your iPhone, connect both to the same standard WPA2/WPA3 home Wi-Fi, unplug HomePod for 10 seconds, plug back in, wait 10 seconds, and hold the top touch surface until it turns red and beeps 3 times to factory reset.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>HomePod fails setup when the iPhone is on a 5 GHz guest/enterprise network with AP Isolation or Keychain/HomeKit sync is off.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Verify iCloud <strong>Passwords &amp; Keychain</strong> and <strong>Home</strong> are enabled on your iPhone, connect both to the same standard WPA2/WPA3 home Wi-Fi, unplug HomePod for 10 seconds, plug back in, wait 10 seconds, and hold the top touch surface until it turns red and beeps 3 times to factory reset.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Always verify an up-to-date iCloud or local Finder/iTunes backup before choosing Restore in Recovery Mode, and never enter your Apple Account credentials on third-party unlock websites.\n</div>"
