    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Account Limitations, Permanent 180-Day Holds &amp; Identity Verification / KYC</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">PayPal blocks account closure whenever any of the following exist: an active limitation, a non-zero balance (even <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">$0.01</code> positive or negative), open disputes/claims, pending eChecks, or unresolved recurring billing agreements. Clear every open dispute, bring your balance to exactly <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">$0.00</code>, cancel active automatic payments, lift any temporary limitation, and retry under <strong>Settings &gt; Account Options &gt; Close your account</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>PayPal blocks account closure whenever any of the following exist: an active limitation, a non-zero balance (even <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">$0.01</code> positive or negative), open disputes/claims, pending eChecks, or unresolved recurring billing agreements.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Clear every open dispute, bring your balance to exactly <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">$0.00</code>, cancel active automatic payments, lift any temporary limitation, and retry under <strong>Settings &gt; Account Options &gt; Close your account</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Security Advisory: Never call phone numbers pasted inside PayPal invoice notes or urgent emails. Always type paypal.com manually into your browser to check your Resolution Center, and never share 2FA codes or remote screen access with anyone.\n</div>"
