    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Transfers, Withdrawals, Linked Bank/Card Declines &amp; Negative Balances</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Standard ACH transfers take 1–3 business days (excluding weekends and bank holidays), or up to 5 days for smaller credit unions. Verify the <strong>last 4 digits</strong> of the destination bank account in PayPal Activity; if the account number had a typo or was closed, the bank rejects the ACH and returns the funds to your PayPal Balance within 5–10 business days (minus a returned-transfer fee in some regions).</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Standard ACH transfers take 1–3 business days (excluding weekends and bank holidays), or up to 5 days for smaller credit unions.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Verify the <strong>last 4 digits</strong> of the destination bank account in PayPal Activity; if the account number had a typo or was closed, the bank rejects the ACH and returns the funds to your PayPal Balance within 5–10 business days (minus a returned-transfer fee in some regions).</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Security Advisory: Never call phone numbers pasted inside PayPal invoice notes or urgent emails. Always type paypal.com manually into your browser to check your Resolution Center, and never share 2FA codes or remote screen access with anyone.\n</div>"
