    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Pay in 4, PayPal Credit, Crypto, Venmo Sync, 1099-K Taxes &amp; Login/2FA Lockouts</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Error <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">10755</code> happens when a merchant's checkout requests a currency unsupported by PayPal or blocked in the seller's <strong>Payment Receiving Preferences</strong>. Sellers should go to <strong>Account Settings &gt; Payment Preferences &gt; Block Payments</strong> and allow currency conversion, while buyers should confirm their checkout currency matches an accepted PayPal currency (USD, EUR, GBP, CAD, AUD, etc.).</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Error <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">10755</code> happens when a merchant's checkout requests a currency unsupported by PayPal or blocked in the seller's <strong>Payment Receiving Preferences</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Sellers should go to <strong>Account Settings &gt; Payment Preferences &gt; Block Payments</strong> and allow currency conversion, while buyers should confirm their checkout currency matches an accepted PayPal currency (USD, EUR, GBP, CAD, AUD, etc.).</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Security Advisory: Never call phone numbers pasted inside PayPal invoice notes or urgent emails. Always type paypal.com manually into your browser to check your Resolution Center, and never share 2FA codes or remote screen access with anyone.\n</div>"
