    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Amazon Prime Billing, Unexpected Charges, Subscribe &amp; Save &amp; Prime Video Errors</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Open <strong>Your Account &gt; Subscribe &amp; Save &gt; Subscriptions</strong>, click each active product, and select <strong>Cancel subscription</strong> (note: clicking &quot;Skip&quot; only skips one month). Cancel at least <strong>24–48 hours before the listed &quot;Last day to edit&quot;</strong> date so the warehouse doesn't already lock the shipment for dispatch.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Open <strong>Your Account &gt; Subscribe &amp; Save &gt; Subscriptions</strong>, click each active product, and select <strong>Cancel subscription</strong> (note: clicking &quot;Skip&quot; only skips one month).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Cancel at least <strong>24–48 hours before the listed &quot;Last day to edit&quot;</strong> date so the warehouse doesn't already lock the shipment for dispatch.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Security Advisory: Verify all Amazon account alerts and order notifications directly inside Your Account &gt; Message Center on amazon.com. Never click links in unsolicited &quot;order confirmed&quot; texts or buy discounted gift cards from unverified resellers.\n</div>"
