    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Fire TV Stick, Fire Tablet &amp; Kindle E-Reader Troubleshooting</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Standard 8 GB Fire Sticks fill rapidly with hidden app caches and screensaver/bloat files. Go to <strong>Settings &gt; Applications &gt; Manage Installed Applications</strong>, sort by size, click <strong>Clear Cache</strong> (not Clear Data) on Prime Video, Netflix, YouTube, and Silk Browser, uninstall unused apps, and turn off <strong>Featured Content Autoplay</strong> under <strong>Settings &gt; Preferences</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Standard 8 GB Fire Sticks fill rapidly with hidden app caches and screensaver/bloat files.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Go to <strong>Settings &gt; Applications &gt; Manage Installed Applications</strong>, sort by size, click <strong>Clear Cache</strong> (not Clear Data) on Prime Video, Netflix, YouTube, and Silk Browser, uninstall unused apps, and turn off <strong>Featured Content Autoplay</strong> under <strong>Settings &gt; Preferences</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Security Advisory: Verify all Amazon account alerts and order notifications directly inside Your Account &gt; Message Center on amazon.com. Never click links in unsolicited &quot;order confirmed&quot; texts or buy discounted gift cards from unverified resellers.\n</div>"
