    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Fire TV Stick, Fire Tablet &amp; Kindle E-Reader Troubleshooting</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Most missing Kindle books are caused by being logged into a different Amazon email or having the Library filter set to <strong>Downloaded</strong> instead of <strong>All</strong>. Switch the Library tab to <strong>All</strong>, tap <strong>Sync</strong> from the top quick-settings bar, confirm your device is listed under <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">amazon.com/mycd</code> (<strong>Content &amp; Devices</strong>), click <strong>Deliver or Remove from Device</strong>, and verify your 1-Click payment didn't fail.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Most missing Kindle books are caused by being logged into a different Amazon email or having the Library filter set to <strong>Downloaded</strong> instead of <strong>All</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Switch the Library tab to <strong>All</strong>, tap <strong>Sync</strong> from the top quick-settings bar, confirm your device is listed under <code class=\"kb-inline-code\">amazon.com/mycd</code> (<strong>Content &amp; Devices</strong>), click <strong>Deliver or Remove from Device</strong>, and verify your 1-Click payment didn't fail.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Security Advisory: Verify all Amazon account alerts and order notifications directly inside Your Account &gt; Message Center on amazon.com. Never click links in unsolicited &quot;order confirmed&quot; texts or buy discounted gift cards from unverified resellers.\n</div>"
