    "content": "<div class=\"ai-direct-answer\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\n    <div class=\"ai-answer-badge\">&#9889; Quick Expert Answer &bull; Kaspersky / UltraAV Migration, ESET, Webroot, Trend Micro &amp; Cross-Antivirus Issues</div>\n    <p itemprop=\"text\">Kaspersky update servers are blocked on US IP addresses due to regulatory sanctions, and regional activation keys only activate within the country of purchase. Users outside restricted regions should verify system clock/VPN off and update via Kaspersky's regional server; US users must uninstall Kaspersky cleanly using the <strong>kavremover</strong> utility and migrate to a supported security suite or Windows Defender.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>Step-by-Step Diagnostic &amp; Resolution Protocol</h4>\n\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 1</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Root Cause &amp; Initial Verification</div>\n    <p>Kaspersky update servers are blocked on US IP addresses due to regulatory sanctions, and regional activation keys only activate within the country of purchase.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kb-step-box\">\n    <div class=\"kb-step-num\">Step 2</div>\n    <div class=\"kb-step-title\">Primary Resolution Procedure</div>\n    <p>Users outside restricted regions should verify system clock/VPN off and update via Kaspersky's regional server; US users must uninstall Kaspersky cleanly using the <strong>kavremover</strong> utility and migrate to a supported security suite or Windows Defender.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"kb-warning-box\">\n    <strong>&#9888;&#65039; Expert Safety &amp; Verification Note:</strong> Scam &amp; Safety Warning: Never call toll-free numbers displayed in browser pop-ups or PDF renewal invoices claiming your antivirus charged $399. Always run only ONE real-time antivirus engine at a time and download official removal tools directly from the vendor domain.\n</div>"
