    "directAnswer": "Personal PCs show this error when leftover third-party antivirus policies, Windows debloater tweaks, or malware write UI-hiding keys under HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender Security Center. Run elevated Command Prompt to delete HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Security Health UI and HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender policy overrides, reset Microsoft.SecHealthUI via PowerShell, and reboot.",
